  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "📦 VDocs – Release Notes\n\t\t🚀 Version: 2026.11.2\n        \n        This release corrects a series of OOXML schema‑order violations and packaging defects that caused Word to reject generated documents or silently drop parts during recovery. The fixes span the main document part, the header and footer parts, the content‑types manifest, the relationship manifest, and the two XML mappers (TableStyle, Font).\n\nResult: generated packages are now conformant with ECMA‑376 and open cleanly in Word, LibreOffice, and Google Docs. Header and footer are both rendered.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "VDocs - Word & PDF & HTML Document Framework",
  "verbatimVersion": "2026.11.2",
